          "table": null,
          "figure": "3b",
          "chunk_id": "ed0243ccfa8f5521:part:001"
        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "section": "Discussion",
          "quote": "Since the amount of the FCC fraction reduction is close to that of BCC increase during tensile deformation, it can be concluded that FCC to BCC TRIP occurs in Fe44.6Co34.8Cr10.3V10.2 MPEA during deformation.",
